{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45905","headline":"夜对雪寄杜使君 · 贯休","name":"夜对雪寄杜使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片片含天意，纷纷势莫拘。\n洒於诸瑞後，忧恐一冬无。\n鹤凚声偏密，风焦片益粗。\n冷牵人梦转，清逼瘴根徂。\n扫径僧倾笠，爲诗士弃炉。\n桥高银螮蝀，峰峻玉浮图。\n盈尺何须问，丰年已可□。\n遥思郢中曲，句句出冰壶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}